| QR corners (TL, TR, BR, BL) | `(660,30), (820,30), (820,210), (660,210)` | `CardTemplate.SHARED_QR_CORNERS` | QR area in template |
| Marker centres (TL, BR, BL) | `(25,25), (825,515), (25,515)` | `CardTemplate.SHARED_MARKER_CORNERS` | Reference markers |
| Candidate bubble positions | 12 points | `CardTemplate.CANDIDATE.bubblePositions` | Bubble locations |
| Agenda bubble positions | 12 points | `CardTemplate.AGENDA.bubblePositions` | Bubble locations |
| Candidate groups | `[0..11]` | `CardTemplate.CANDIDATE_GROUPS` | Single race |
| Agenda groups | `[0..2], [3..5], [6..8], [9..11]` | `CardTemplate.AGENDA_GROUPS` | Four independent rows |
| Camera resolution | 1280×720 | `ScannerScreen.startCamera()` | Capture resolution |
| Downsample size | 800×450 | `ScannerScreen.downsampleBitmap()` | Fast edge detection |
| Marker search margin | 40 px | `CardDetector.MARKER_SEARCH_MARGIN_PX` | Window size for marker search |
| Marker darkness threshold | 80 | `CardDetector.MARKER_DARKNESS_THRESHOLD` | Dark pixel cutoff |
| Marker min dark pixels | 15 | `CardDetector.MARKER_MIN_DARK_PIXELS` | Minimum accepted marker size |
| Bubble sample radius (live) | 15 px | `BubbleAnalyzer.sampleDarkness()` | Overlay classification |
| Bubble z‑score threshold | 1.3 | `BubbleAnalyzer.classifyByGroup()` | Overlay sensitivity |
| Bubble sample radius (final) | 20 px | `OMRExtractor.BUBBLE_RADIUS` | Accurate OMR sampling |
| Motion epsilon | 6 px | `ScannerScreen.MOTION_EPSILON_PX` | Stability threshold |
| Stable frames required | 4 | `ScannerScreen.STABLE_FRAMES_REQUIRED` | Auto‑capture delay |
| Frame queue size | 5 | `ScannerScreen.MAX_QUEUE` | Averaging buffer |
| Otsu threshold | Dynamic | `ImagePreprocessor.otsuThreshold()` | Global dark/light split |
| Borderline margin | 15% of threshold | `OMRExtractor.extractMarksWithConfidence()` | Confidence adjustment |

